, "width": 7, "height": 751.89, "locked": false, "zIndex": 1, "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "metadata": {"editable": true}, "rotation": 0, "borderColor": "transparent", "borderWidth": 0, "borderRadius": 14, "backgroundColor": "#a65f42"}, {"x": 63, "y": 74, "id": "overlay-0f3e5e12-3a6c-4062-bd1c-e25b2d98a1d4", "type": "overlay", "width": 34, "height": 34, "locked": false, "zIndex": 4, "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "metadata": {"role": "section-number-circle", "editable": true}, "rotation": 0, "borderColor": "#d8b29b", "borderWidth": 1, "borderRadius": 17, "backgroundColor": "#ecd2c2"}, {"x": 63, "y": 74, "id": "text-ee5dbbb8-36c0-4e30-ab13-33e14061874e", "type": "text", "align": "center", "color": "#7d402a", "width": 34, "height": 34, "locked": false, "zIndex": 5, "content": "01", "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "fontSize": 10, "metadata": {"role": "section-number", "editable": true}, "rotation": 0, "fontStyle": "normal", "fontFamily": "Helvetica", "fontWeight": "700", "lineHeight": 1, "hideIfEmpty": false, "letterSpacing": 0, "textTransform": "none"}, {"x": 112, "y": 70, "id": "text-c55ee8de-d8fe-454d-931b-79907f28ccf6", "type": "text", "align": "left", "color": "#7d402a", "width": 405, "height": 52, "locked": false, "zIndex": 1, "content": "COMO SERÁ REALIZADO O\\n                       PAGAMENTO DO SERVIÇO?", "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "fontSize": 16.5, "metadata": {"editable": true}, "rotation": 0, "fontStyle": "normal", "fontFamily": "Georgia", "fontWeight": "400", "lineHeight": 1.18, "hideIfEmpty": false, "letterSpacing": 0.3, "textTransform": "none"}, {"x": 112, "y": 124, "id": "overlay-0d829f7c-ed93-4c5d-b932-c167f25e05b9", "type": "overlay", "width": 405, "height": 1, "locked": false, "zIndex": 1, "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "metadata": {"editable": true}, "rotation": 0, "borderColor": "transparent", "borderWidth": 0, "borderRadius": 0, "backgroundColor": "#dfc7b7"}, {"x": 72, "y": 134, "id": "text-49c0e279-6b85-4351-b390-e763b2884b1e", "type": "text", "align": "left", "color": "#2d2724", "width": 443, "height": 645.89, "locked": false, "zIndex": 1, "content": "CLÁUSULA 4ª Pela contratação dos serviços, o pagamento se dará\\nconforme tabela disponibilizada na página 4.\\n\\nPARÁGRAFO PRIMEIRO Caso o pagamento seja realizado através de pix ou\\ntransferência bancária, o valor será depositado na conta corrente da\\nCONTRATADA da seguinte forma:\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n               CHAVE PIX: Telefone 73988936763\\n               BANCO: NuBank\\n               FAVORECIDO: Camilla Silva Barros Vitor\\n\\n\\n\\n\\nPARÁGRAFO SEGUNDO A data do ensaio só será reservada com o\\npagamento de um sinal de 30% do valor integral.\\n\\nPARÁGRAFO TERCEIRO Em caso de atraso no pagamento do valor\\nconvencionado nesta cláusula, incidirá (l) multa moratória de 10% (dez por\\ncento) sobre o valor devido; (ll) juros de 1% (um por cento) ao mês, e (lll)\\natualização monetária calculada com base na variação do IGP-M/FGV até a\\ndata do efetivo pagamento da parcela devida.", "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "fontSize": 11, "metadata": {"editable": true}, "rotation": 0, "fontStyle": "normal", "fontFamily": "Helvetica", "fontWeight": "400", "lineHeight": 1.38, "hideIfEmpty": false, "letterSpacing": 0, "textTransform": "none"}, {"x": 48, "y": 812, "id": "overlay-1decb60e-6b62-41a7-b6fb-d8e701151fc0", "type": "overlay", "width": 499, "height": 1, "locked": false, "zIndex": 1, "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "metadata": {"editable": true}, "rotation": 0, "borderColor": "transparent", "borderWidth": 0, "borderRadius": 0, "backgroundColor": "#dfc7b7"}, {"x": 270, "y": 816, "id": "text-5f12a691-721a-4eac-a411-f060dc9d0f53", "type": "text", "align": "center", "color": "#766961", "width": 55, "height": 16, "locked": false, "zIndex": 1, "content": "07", "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "fontSize": 7.5, "metadata": {"editable": true}, "rotation": 0, "fontStyle": "normal", "fontFamily": "Helvetica", "fontWeight": "400", "lineHeight": 1.4, "hideIfEmpty": false