rue}, "rotation": 0, "fontStyle": "normal", "fontFamily": "Helvetica", "fontWeight": "400", "lineHeight": 1.36, "hideIfEmpty": false, "letterSpacing": 0, "textTransform": "none"}, {"x": 72, "y": 452.8522017126546, "id": "overlay-5345782d-efac-4f96-8599-2242789194d0", "type": "overlay", "width": 94, "height": 44, "locked": false, "zIndex": 1, "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "metadata": {"role": "legal-label-background", "groupId": "legal-row-7e787ebf-2109-44b2-acfe-f2ec81cc9287", "editable": true, "structuredLegal": true}, "rotation": 0, "borderColor": "#dfc7b7", "borderWidth": 1, "borderRadius": 10, "backgroundColor": "#f3e2d6"}, {"x": 78, "y": 456.8522017126546, "id": "text-039312c1-0af1-4aee-ab1e-2205f344b0f8", "type": "text", "align": "center", "color": "#7d402a", "width": 82, "height": 36, "locked": false, "zIndex": 2, "content": "PARÁGRAFO QUARTO", "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "fontSize": 8.8, "metadata": {"role": "legal-label", "groupId": "legal-row-7e787ebf-2109-44b2-acfe-f2ec81cc9287", "editable": true, "originalText": "PARÁGRAFO QUARTO", "structuredLegal": true}, "rotation": 0, "fontStyle": "normal", "fontFamily": "Helvetica", "fontWeight": "700", "lineHeight": 1.08, "hideIfEmpty": false, "letterSpacing": 0, "textTransform": "none"}, {"x": 178, "y": 452.8522017126546, "id": "text-8108b5b4-8e5b-442d-9adb-57747a360628", "type": "text", "align": "left", "color": "#2d2724", "width": 337, "height": 70.97305042816365, "locked": false, "zIndex": 2, "content": ": As fotos tratadas e entregues permanecem arquivadas até 2 anos no máximo a contar da entrega dos produtos. (Indicamos que assim que sejam recebidos os arquivos seja feito um backup imediato).", "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "fontSize": 9, "metadata": {"role": "legal-copy", "groupId": "legal-row-7e787ebf-2109-44b2-acfe-f2ec81cc9287", "editable": true, "originalText": ": As fotos tratadas e entregues permanecem arquivadas até 2 anos no máximo a contar da entrega dos produtos. (Indicamos que assim que sejam recebidos os arquivos seja feito um backup imediato).", "structuredLegal": true, "preserveFullText": true}, "rotation": 0, "fontStyle": "normal", "fontFamily": "Helvetica", "fontWeight": "400", "lineHeight": 1.36, "hideIfEmpty": false, "letterSpacing": 0, "textTransform": "none"}, {"x": 72, "y": 621.8252521408183, "id": "overlay-d8a1f4b6-9885-4540-a522-1392aa9f89f7", "type": "overlay", "width": 94, "height": 44, "locked": false, "zIndex": 1, "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "metadata": {"role": "legal-label-background", "groupId": "legal-row-60993032-360e-4423-815d-af6bb3ec9cff", "editable": true, "structuredLegal": true}, "rotation": 0, "borderColor": "#dfc7b7", "borderWidth": 1, "borderRadius": 10, "backgroundColor": "#f3e2d6"}, {"x": 78, "y": 625.8252521408183, "id": "text-704b22e4-6ad8-4c7f-95df-f91d21a558cf", "type": "text", "align": "center", "color": "#7d402a", "width": 82, "height": 36, "locked": false, "zIndex": 2, "content": "CLÁUSULA 3ª", "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "fontSize": 8.8, "metadata": {"role": "legal-label", "groupId": "legal-row-60993032-360e-4423-815d-af6bb3ec9cff", "editable": true, "originalText": "CLÁUSULA 3ª", "structuredLegal": true}, "rotation": 0, "fontStyle": "normal", "fontFamily": "Helvetica", "fontWeight": "700", "lineHeight": 1.08, "hideIfEmpty": false, "letterSpacing": 0, "textTransform": "none"}, {"x": 178, "y": 621.8252521408183, "id": "text-7088017b-81c0-4fb3-92e3-31bbf4e63609", "type": "text", "align": "left", "color": "#2d2724", "width": 337, "height": 164.06474785918175, "locked": false, "zIndex": 2, "content": "Os álbuns são contratados a parte. Caso seja contratado, o cliente deverá fazer a seleção das fotos que irão compor esse álbum no mesmo momento em que fará a seleção das fotos, ou seja, no prazo de 10 dias após a disponibilização das fotos.", "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "fontSize": 10.1, "metadata": {"role": "legal-copy", "groupId": "legal-row-60993032-360e-4423-815d-af6bb3ec9cff", "editable": true, "originalTex