o o pagamento do deslocamento de R$ 3,00 por km rodado (ida e volta) + despesas com hospedagem e alimentação durante o evento.", "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "fontSize": 10.8, "metadata": {"role": "legal-copy", "groupId": "legal-row-27c96a0e-5aca-41de-9bc2-b562b80a5d25", "editable": true, "originalText": "Fica a cargo do CONTRATANTE para eventos/ensaios fora de Porto Seguro o pagamento do deslocamento de R$ 3,00 por km rodado (ida e volta) + despesas com hospedagem e alimentação durante o evento.", "structuredLegal": true, "preserveFullText": true}, "rotation": 0, "fontStyle": "normal", "fontFamily": "Helvetica", "fontWeight": "400", "lineHeight": 1.36, "hideIfEmpty": false, "letterSpacing": 0, "textTransform": "none"}, {"x": 72, "y": 321.6540562248996, "id": "text-e99a566c-1a42-4871-b85e-9e28ed52b467", "type": "text", "align": "center", "color": "#7d402a", "width": 443, "height": 68.8478313253012, "locked": false, "zIndex": 2, "content": "DURAÇÃO DO CONTRATO", "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "fontSize": 14.5, "metadata": {"role": "legal-subtitle", "groupId": "legal-row-54674215-c3e0-4171-96d4-8c38a8aadf54", "editable": true, "originalText": "DURAÇÃO DO CONTRATO", "structuredLegal": true, "preserveFullText": true}, "rotation": 0, "fontStyle": "normal", "fontFamily": "Georgia", "fontWeight": "400", "lineHeight": 1.14, "hideIfEmpty": false, "letterSpacing": 0.2, "textTransform": "none"}, {"x": 72, "y": 399.50188755020076, "id": "overlay-b198eed7-0b2b-49cb-9d00-d7172c419f2d", "type": "overlay", "width": 94, "height": 44, "locked": false, "zIndex": 1, "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "metadata": {"role": "legal-label-background", "groupId": "legal-row-e3f67931-8c9d-4d1f-bfb7-3cea7c5b8917", "editable": true, "structuredLegal": true}, "rotation": 0, "borderColor": "#dfc7b7", "borderWidth": 1, "borderRadius": 10, "backgroundColor": "#f3e2d6"}, {"x": 78, "y": 403.50188755020076, "id": "text-08499911-057b-441b-a43b-d42859984d0b", "type": "text", "align": "center", "color": "#7d402a", "width": 82, "height": 36, "locked": false, "zIndex": 2, "content": "CLÁUSULA 9ª", "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "fontSize": 8.8, "metadata": {"role": "legal-label", "groupId": "legal-row-e3f67931-8c9d-4d1f-bfb7-3cea7c5b8917", "editable": true, "originalText": "CLÁUSULA 9ª", "structuredLegal": true}, "rotation": 0, "fontStyle": "normal", "fontFamily": "Helvetica", "fontWeight": "700", "lineHeight": 1.08, "hideIfEmpty": false, "letterSpacing": 0, "textTransform": "none"}, {"x": 178, "y": 399.50188755020076, "id": "text-7809cab5-f3c0-4510-8ea2-8502354f5b6e", "type": "text", "align": "left", "color": "#2d2724", "width": 337, "height": 188.69405622489958, "locked": false, "zIndex": 2, "content": "Este contrato vigorará até a data em que forem entregues todos os serviços do pacote escolhido, ocasião em que será cumprida a obrigação dos fotógrafos.", "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "fontSize": 10.8, "metadata": {"role": "legal-copy", "groupId": "legal-row-e3f67931-8c9d-4d1f-bfb7-3cea7c5b8917", "editable": true, "originalText": "Este contrato vigorará até a data em que forem entregues todos os serviços do pacote escolhido, ocasião em que será cumprida a obrigação dos fotógrafos.", "structuredLegal": true, "preserveFullText": true}, "rotation": 0, "fontStyle": "normal", "fontFamily": "Helvetica", "fontWeight": "400", "lineHeight": 1.36, "hideIfEmpty": false, "letterSpacing": 0, "textTransform": "none"}, {"x": 72, "y": 597.1959437751003, "id": "overlay-71595063-5695-46f7-9e8a-d54ecc1b57d9", "type": "overlay", "width": 94, "height": 44, "locked": false, "zIndex": 1, "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "metadata": {"role": "legal-label-background", "groupId": "legal-row-2a1c07e6-b5f9-4394-bf92-fcf62066ff69", "editable": true, "structuredLegal": true}, "rotation": 0, "borderColor": "#dfc7b7", "borderWidth": 1, "borderRadius": 10, "backgroundColor": "#f3e2d6"}, {"x": 78, "y": 601.1959437751003, "id": "text-927684b7-ad73-42bf-8113-796f7a8d79fd", "type": "text", "align": "center", "color": "#7d402a", "width": 82, "height": 36, "locked": false, "zIndex": 2, "content": "PARÁGRAFO PRIMEIRO", "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "fontSize": 8.8, "metadata": {"role": "legal-label", "groupId": "legal-row-2a1c07e6-b5f9-4394-bf92-fcf62066ff69", "editable": true, "originalText": "PARÁGRAFO PRIMEIRO", "structuredLegal": true}, "rotation": 0, "fontStyle": "normal", "fontFamily": "Helvetica", "fontWeight": "700", "lineHeight": 1.08, "hideIfEmpty": false, "letterSpacing": 0, "textTransform": "none"}, {"x": 178, "y": 597.1959437751003, "id": "text-17560b9d-6bb6-4910-a234-32c8f9188eda", "type": "text", "align": "left", "color": "#2d2724", "width": 337, "height": 188.69405622489958, "locked": false, "zIndex": 2, "content": "Quaisquer alterações neste contrato serão válidas e vincularão as partes se forem feitas por termo aditivo devidamente assinado por ambas as partes.", "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "fontSize": 10.8, "metadata": {"role": "legal-copy", "groupId": "legal-row-2a1c07e6-b5f9-4394-bf92-fcf62066ff69", "editable": true, "originalText": "Quaisquer alterações neste contrato serão válidas e vincularão as partes se forem feitas por termo aditivo devidamente assinado por ambas as partes.", "structuredLegal": true, "preserveFullText": true}, "rotation": 0, "fontStyle": "normal", "fontFamily": "Helvetica", "fontWeight": "400", "lineHeight": 1.36, "hideIfEmpty": false, "letterSpacing": 0, "textTransform": "none"}], "metadata": {"designSystem": "editorial-premium-v10", "fixedLegalContent": false, "fullTextPreserved": true, "editableLegalContent": true, "preservesOriginalText": true, "structuredLegalLayoutVersion": 1}, "background": {"url": null, "type": "color", "color": "#fffdf9", "opacity": 1}}, {"id": "contract-page-30193edf-13fa-47f1-887b-e38070b9a288", "name": "DISPOSIÇÕES GERAIS", "order": 10, "width": 595.28, "active": true, "height": 841.89, "elements": [{"x": 48, "y": 14, "id": "text-ee951e35-c161-4dd3-abcf-74ecbf20f48c", "type": "text", "align": 