 "overlay", "width": 405, "height": 1, "locked": false, "zIndex": 1, "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "metadata": {"editable": true}, "rotation": 0, "borderColor": "transparent", "borderWidth": 0, "borderRadius": 0, "backgroundColor": "#dfc7b7"}, {"x": 72, "y": 123.96000000000001, "id": "overlay-398fa296-d988-482d-a27b-d2e136beace1", "type": "overlay", "width": 94, "height": 44, "locked": false, "zIndex": 6, "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "metadata": {"role": "legal-label-background", "groupId": "legal-row-19cadf7d-70ca-4116-818f-412bad62d12a", "editable": true, "structuredLegal": true}, "rotation": 0, "borderColor": "#dfc7b7", "borderWidth": 1, "borderRadius": 10, "backgroundColor": "#f3e2d6"}, {"x": 78, "y": 127.96000000000001, "id": "text-3e476e8d-ab17-4233-b5e1-fea921718310", "type": "text", "align": "center", "color": "#7d402a", "width": 82, "height": 36, "locked": false, "zIndex": 7, "content": "CLÁUSULA 1ª", "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "fontSize": 8.8, "metadata": {"role": "legal-label", "groupId": "legal-row-19cadf7d-70ca-4116-818f-412bad62d12a", "editable": true, "originalText": "CLÁUSULA 1ª", "structuredLegal": true}, "rotation": 0, "fontStyle": "normal", "fontFamily": "Helvetica", "fontWeight": "700", "lineHeight": 1.08, "hideIfEmpty": false, "letterSpacing": 0, "textTransform": "none"}, {"x": 178, "y": 123.96000000000001, "id": "text-a2068953-9cf0-461c-b810-4c8c8d8324a1", "type": "text", "align": "left", "color": "#2d2724", "width": 337, "height": 119.50999999999999, "locked": false, "zIndex": 7, "content": "O objetivo desse contrato é a prestação de serviços de FOTOGRAFIA, que será realizado, nos moldes do plano descrito a cima e incluindo o seguintes serviços:", "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "fontSize": 10.8, "metadata": {"role": "legal-copy", "groupId": "legal-row-19cadf7d-70ca-4116-818f-412bad62d12a", "editable": true, "originalText": "O objetivo desse contrato é a prestação de serviços de FOTOGRAFIA, que será realizado, nos moldes do plano descrito a cima e incluindo o seguintes serviços:", "structuredLegal": true, "preserveFullText": true}, "rotation": 0, "fontStyle": "normal", "fontFamily": "Helvetica", "fontWeight": "400", "lineHeight": 1.36, "hideIfEmpty": false, "letterSpacing": 0, "textTransform": "none"}, {"x": 72, "y": 252.47, "id": "text-286f030f-78a3-4baa-9536-3fc8d1894a0f", "type": "text", "align": "left", "color": "#2d2724", "width": 443, "height": 96.89999999999998, "locked": false, "zIndex": 7, "content": "Cobertura fotográfica completa do casamento, cerimonia e pós casamento, a depender do pacote escolhido, em local específico para as sessões. Caso haja necessidade de cobertura após esse horário, poderá ser cobrado valor adicional por hora excedente.", "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "fontSize": 10.8, "metadata": {"role": "legal-copy", "groupId": "legal-row-6566e062-15b2-4ec0-b68a-0ec326002721", "editable": true, "originalText": "Cobertura fotográfica completa do casamento, cerimonia e pós casamento, a depender do pacote escolhido, em local específico para as sessões. Caso haja necessidade de cobertura após esse horário, poderá ser cobrado valor adicional por hora excedente.", "structuredLegal": true, "preserveFullText": true}, "rotation": 0, "fontStyle": "normal", "fontFamily": "Helvetica", "fontWeight": "400", "lineHeight": 1.36, "hideIfEmpty": false, "letterSpacing": 0, "textTransform": "none"}, {"x": 72, "y": 358.37, "id": "text-a83a2312-61a6-41ff-995f-f1186e33a208", "type": "text", "align": "left", "color": "#2d2724", "width": 443, "height": 64.6, "locked": false, "zIndex": 7, "content": "Disponibilização de todas as fotos editadas e devidamente selecionadas entregues em plataforma própria;", "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "fontSize": 10.8, "metadata": {"role": "legal-copy", "groupId": "legal-row-ed9d28c0-4a62-4a46-8d8c-79de58166079", "editable": true, "originalText": "Disponibilização de todas as fotos editadas e devidamente selecionadas entregues em plataforma própria;", "structuredLegal": true, "preserveFullText": true}, "rotation": 0, "fontStyle": "normal", "fontFamily": "Helvetica", "fontWeight": "400", "lineHeight": 1.36, "hideIfEmpty": false, "letterSpacing": 0, "textTransform": "none"}, {"x": 72, "y": 431.97, "id": "text-bce3d882-2013-4fad-99b9-3d4014a9910c", "type": "text", "align": "left", "color": "#2d2724", "width": 443, "height": 43.605000000000004, "locked": false, "zIndex": 7, "content": "Álbum caso contratado;", "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "fontSize": 10.8, "metadata": {"role": "legal-copy", "groupId": "legal-row-03c2e3b1-6bcd-4ed6-9cde-248877a59d36", "editable": true, "originalText": "Álbum caso contratado;", "structuredLegal": true, "preserveFullText": true}, "rotation": 0, "fontStyle": "normal", "fontFamily": "Helvetica", "fontWeight": "400", "lineHeight": 1.36, "hideIfEmpty": false, "letterSpacing": 0, "textTransform": "none"}, {"x": 72, "y": 484.57500000000005, "id": "text-080dae9b-90da-42b6-b4c2-bb25c3678164", "type": "text", "align": "left", "color": "#2d2724", "width": 443, "height": 43.605000000000004, "locked": false, "zIndex": 7, "content": "Fotos impressas caso contratado.", "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "fontSize": 10.8, "metadata": {"role": "legal-copy", "groupId": "legal-row-6abf63e2-c82c-4dbd-a602-e724256ba4a7", "editable": true, "originalText": "Fotos impressas caso contratado.", "structuredLegal": true, "preserveFullText": true}, "rotation": 0, "fontStyle": "normal", "fontFamily": "Helvetica", "fontWeight": "400", "lineHeight": 1.36, "hideIfEmpty": false, "letterSpacing": 0, "textTransform": "none"}, {"x": 72, "y": 537.1800000000001, "id": "overlay-6bb46da2-681f-4965-a439-b2607909b4cd", "type": "overlay", "width": 94, "height": 44, "locked": false, "zIndex": 6, "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "metadata": {"role": "legal-label-background", "groupId": "legal-row-a26df483-c959-487b-a656-dd12fb46b6e8", "editable": true, "structuredLegal": true}, "rotation": 0, "borderColor": "#dfc7b7", "borderWidth": 1, "borderRadius": 10, "backgroundColor": "#f3e2d6"}, {"x": 78, "y": 541.1800000000001, "id": "text-5582c3b7-d058-47e8-850c-9fccb2b35a98", "type": "text", "align": "center", "color": "#7d402a", "width": 82, "height": 36, "locked": false, "zIndex": 7, "content": "PARÁGRAFO PRIMEIRO", "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "fontSize": 8.8, "metadata": {"role": "legal-label", "groupId": "legal-row-a26df483-c959-487b-a656-dd12fb46b6e8", "editable": true, "originalText": "PARÁGRAFO PRIMEIRO", "structuredLegal": true}, "rotation": 0, "fontStyle": "normal", "fontFamily": "Helvetica", "fontWeight": "700", "lineHeight": 1.08, "hideIfEmpty": false, "letterSpacing": 0, "textTransform": "none"}, {"x": 178, "y": 537.1800000000001, "id": "text-7f211dc2-22aa-452c-9d4f-d4eaa4035ebd", "type": "text", "align": "left", "color": "#2d2724", "width": 337, "height": 248.70999999999995, "locked": false, "zIndex": 7, "content": ": O CONTRATANTE está ciente que o CONTRATADO precisa do auxílio do cerimonial com a organização das fotos, a logística de lista de fotos protocolares, no entanto não precisa de auxílio do cerimonial ou outra pessoa com a “direção da fotografia” ou “ideia de poses” por trabalhar de forma diferenciada buscando a naturalidade e dirigindo os noivos de forma leve e tranquila para que aproveitem de verdade o casamento. (importante informar o cerimonial).", "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "fontSize": 10.8, "metadata": {"role": "legal-copy", "groupId": "legal-row-a26df483-c959-487b-a656-dd12fb46b6e8", "editable": true, "originalText": ": O CONTRATANTE está ciente que o CONTRATADO precisa do auxílio do cerimonial com a organização das fotos, a logística de lista de fotos protocolares, no entanto não precisa de auxílio do cerimonial ou outra pessoa com a “direção da fotografia” ou “ideia de poses” por trabalhar de forma diferenciada buscando a naturalidade e dirigindo os noivos de forma leve e tranquila para que aproveitem de verdade o casamento. (importante informar o cerimonial).", "structuredLegal": true, "preserveFullText": true}, "rotation": 0, "fontStyle": "normal", "fontFamily": "Helvetica", "fontWeight": "400", "lineHeight": 1.36, "hideIfEmpty": false, "letterSpacing": 0, "textTransform": "none"}, {"x": 48, "y": 812, "id": "overlay-7114482b-b28e-4d63-8680-83a16cac76ac", "type": "overlay", "width": 499, "height": 1, "locked": false, "zIndex": 1, "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "metadata": {"editable": true}, "rotation": 0, "borderColor": "transparent", "borderWidth": 0, "borderRadius": 0, "backgroundColor": "#dfc7b7"}, {"x": 270, "y": 816, "id": "text-1c29c23f-ebe6-436e-958f-29f7f4ced915", "type": "text", "align": "center", "color": "#766961", "width": 55, "height": 16, "locked": false, "zIndex": 1, "content": "05", "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "fontSize": 7.5, "metadata": {"editable": true}, "rotation": 0, "fontStyle": "normal", "fontFamily": "Helvetica", "fontWeight": "400", "lineHeight": 1.4, "hideIfEmpty": false, "letterSpacing": 1, "textTransform": "none"}], "metadata": {"designSystem": "editorial-premium-v12", "fixedLegalContent": false, "editableLegalContent": true, "preservesOriginalText": true}, "background": {"url": null, "type": "color", "color": "#fffdf9", "opacity": 1}}, {"id": "contract-page-f5a41494-aa98-4898-9399-eeb5bd6c8960", "name": "Procedimento e álbuns", "order": 5, "width": 595.28, "active": true, "height": 841.89, "elements": [{"x": 48, "y": 14, "id": "text-5a848d77-4bdc-4ff9-8a5f-1618987881f6", "type": "text", "align": "left", "color": "#766961", "width": 330, "height": 18, "locked": false, "zIndex": 1, "content": "CONTRATO DE PRESTAÇÃO DE SERVIÇOS", "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "fontSize": 7.8, "metadata": {"editable": true}, "rotation": 0, "fontStyle": "normal", "fontFamily": "Helvetica", "fontWeight": "700", "lineHeight": 1.4, "hideIfEmpty": false, "letterSpacing": 1, "textTransform": "none"}, {"x": 505, "y": 11, "id": "text-18f809b8-477e-4b8b-8f15-e60005fdc5eb", "type": "text", "align": "center", "color": "#c08b6e", "width"