"fontFamily": "Helvetica", "fontWeight": "700", "lineHeight": 1, "hideIfEmpty": false, "letterSpacing": 0, "textTransform": "none"}, {"x": 112, "y": 312.52652427184466, "id": "text-697252b3-d836-4bad-9506-1bbb652fe6e4", "type": "text", "align": "left", "color": "#7d402a", "width": 405, "height": 43.96, "locked": false, "zIndex": 1, "content": "ANEXO IV Orientações e Condições para o Dia do Evento", "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "fontSize": 15.5, "metadata": {"role": "section-title", "editable": true}, "rotation": 0, "fontStyle": "normal", "fontFamily": "Georgia", "fontWeight": "400", "lineHeight": 1.16, "hideIfEmpty": false, "letterSpacing": 0.2, "textTransform": "none"}, {"x": 112, "y": 359.48652427184464, "id": "overlay-e0ce8236-d11c-4899-a729-b0b06d2f75e9", "type": "overlay", "width": 405, "height": 1, "locked": false, "zIndex": 1, "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "metadata": {"editable": true}, "rotation": 0, "borderColor": "transparent", "borderWidth": 0, "borderRadius": 0, "backgroundColor": "#dfc7b7"}, {"x": 72, "y": 368.4865242718447, "id": "text-689ab6c7-4d26-42d2-b777-a61b545c3094", "type": "text", "align": "left", "color": "#2d2724", "width": 443, "height": 32.54725797503467, "locked": false, "zIndex": 7, "content": "Evento: Casamento Data: {{work.date}} Noivos: {{wedding.coupleNames}}", "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "fontSize": 10.1, "metadata": {"role": "legal-copy", "groupId": "legal-row-84f839bb-c4e5-45f7-a422-678496e78cb2", "editable": true, "originalText": "Evento: Casamento Data: {{work.date}} Noivos: {{wedding.coupleNames}}", "structuredLegal": true, "preserveFullText": true}, "rotation": 0, "fontStyle": "normal", "fontFamily": "Helvetica", "fontWeight": "400", "lineHeight": 1.36, "hideIfEmpty": false, "letterSpacing": 0, "textTransform": "none"}, {"x": 72, "y": 410.03378224687935, "id": "text-48eda42d-278e-41a9-b0b5-e3fd6fbe9233", "type": "text", "align": "left", "color": "#2d2724", "width": 443, "height": 32.54725797503467, "locked": false, "zIndex": 7, "content": "Este anexo apresenta orientações para facilitar o registro fotográfico do evento.", "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "fontSize": 10.1, "metadata": {"role": "legal-copy", "groupId": "legal-row-7c622121-cc65-4c99-87cc-37f6d753f5f5", "editable": true, "originalText": "Este anexo apresenta orientações para facilitar o registro fotográfico do evento.", "structuredLegal": true, "preserveFullText": true}, "rotation": 0, "fontStyle": "normal", "fontFamily": "Helvetica", "fontWeight": "400", "lineHeight": 1.36, "hideIfEmpty": false, "letterSpacing": 0, "textTransform": "none"}, {"x": 72, "y": 451.581040221914, "id": "text-84f865e7-9497-414e-8af3-cda60382492e", "type": "text", "align": "left", "color": "#2d2724", "width": 443, "height": 48.21815996301433, "locked": false, "zIndex": 7, "content": "1. Cronograma Atrasos no cronograma podem reduzir o tempo disponível para alguns registros fotográficos.", "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "fontSize": 10.1, "metadata": {"role": "legal-copy", "groupId": "legal-row-1d39682c-4a34-4d3b-93b5-32c302254015", "editable": true, "originalText": "1. Cronograma Atrasos no cronograma podem reduzir o tempo disponível para alguns registros fotográficos.", "structuredLegal": true, "preserveFullText": true}, "rotation": 0, "fontStyle": "normal", "fontFamily": "Helvetica", "fontWeight": "400", "lineHeight": 1.36, "hideIfEmpty": false, "letterSpacing": 0, "textTransform": "none"}, {"x": 72, "y": 508.79920018492834, "id": "text-7d7a9829-5dba-46ea-80e3-672efca7af9c", "type": "text", "align": "left", "color": "#2d2724", "width": 443, "height": 48.21815996301433, "locked": false, "zIndex": 7, "content": "2. Fotos com familiares Recomenda-se indicar uma pessoa para auxiliar na reunião dos familiares durante as fotos.", "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "fontSize": 10.1, "metadata": {"role": "legal-copy", "groupId": "legal-row-a41099c3-0d6c-42ce-a3a1-7eb3c26d4407", "editable": true, "originalText": "2. Fotos com familiares Recomenda-se indicar uma pessoa para auxiliar na reunião dos familiares durante as fotos.", "structuredLegal": true, "preserveFullText": true}, "rotation": 0, "fontStyle": "normal", "fontFamily": "Helvetica", "fontWeight": "400", "lineHeight": 1.36, "hideIfEmpty": false, "letterSpacing": 0, "textTransform": "none"}, {"x": 72, "y": 566.0173601479427, "id": "text-df83a09b-12a5-47cc-8d9a-d7db26dc1579", "type": "text", "align": "left", "color": "#2d2724", "width": 443, "height": 48.21815996301433, "locked": false, "zIndex": 7, "content": "3. Fotos do casal Sempre que possível, recomenda-se reservar de 15 a 30 minutos para fotos exclusivas dos noivos.", "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "fontSize": 10.1, "metadata": {"role": "legal-copy", "groupId": "legal-row-e97c4435-a232-4d79-a0cc-db8192110b59", "editable": true, "originalText": "3. Fotos do casal Sempre que possível, recomenda-se reservar de 15 a 30 minutos para fotos exclusivas dos noivos.", "structuredLegal": true, "preserveFullText": true}, "rotation": 0, "fontStyle": "normal", "fontFamily": "Helvetica", "fontWeight": "400", "lineHeight": 1.36, "hideIfEmpty": false, "letterSpacing": 0, "textTransform": "none"}, {"x": 72, "y": 623.2355201109569, "id": "text-518357ea-15a1-40d4-9cc1-7231b8ec8b31", "type": "text", "align": "left", "color": "#2d2724", "width": 443, "height": 48.21815996301433, "locked": false, "zIndex": 7, "content": "4. Interferência de convidados Convidados utilizando celulares ou câmeras próximas ao fotógrafo podem interferir nas imagens.", "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "fontSize": 10.1, "metadata": {"role": "legal-copy", "groupId": "legal-row-a70fd42a-9c6e-4c84-9e97-9a4f2e55134a", "editable": true, "originalText": "4. Interferência de convidados Convidados utilizando celulares ou câmeras próximas ao fotógrafo podem interferir nas imagens.", "structuredLegal": true, "preserveFullText": true}, "rotation": 0, "fontStyle": "normal", "fontFamily": "Helvetica", "fontWeight": "400", "lineHeight": 1.36, "hideIfEmpty": false, "letterSpacing": 0, "textTransform": "none"}, {"x": 72, "y": 680.4536800739713, "id": "text-93a4a102-b102-4b89-9c6b-ee3b71fd84f6", "type": "text", "align": "left", "color": "#2d2724", "width": 443, "height": 48.21815996301433, "locked": false, "zIndex": 7, "content": "5. Condições do local Iluminação, espaço ou outras condições do ambiente podem influenciar no resultado final das fotografias.", "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "fontSize": 10.1, "metadata": {"role": "legal-copy", "groupId": "legal-row-ef1a17ee-f1d8-4d11-ab96-fa8193c37e21", "editable": true, "originalText": "5. Condições do local Iluminação, espaço ou outras condições do ambiente podem influenciar no resultado final das fotografias.", "structuredLegal": true, "preserveFullText": true}, "rotation": 0, "fontStyle": "normal", "fontFamily": "Helvetica", "fontWeight": "400", "lineHeight": 1.36, "hideIfEmpty": false, "letterSpacing": 0, "textTransform": "none"}, {"x": 72, "y": 737.6718400369857, "id": "text-d671f307-34de-4a24-a52a-7c84dd7f0312", "type": "text", "align": "left", "color": "#2d2724", "width": 443, "height": 48.21815996301433, "locked": false, "zIndex": 7, "content": "Declaro estar ciente das orientações acima. CONTRATANTES _______________________________________________ CONTRATADA _______________________________________________", "opacity": 1, "visible": true, "fontSize": 10.1, "metadata": {"role": "legal-copy", "groupId": "legal-row-1d7bfda0-aa0f-4630-95ce-cf96272a3b9f", "editable": true, "originalText": "Declaro estar ciente das orientações acima. CONTRATANTES _______________________________________________ CONTRATADA _______________________________________________", "structuredLegal": true, "preserveFullText": true}, "rotation": 0, "fontStyle": "normal", "fontFamily": "Helvetica", "fontWeight": "400", "lineHeight": 1.36, "hideIfEmpty": false, "letterSpacing": 0, "textTransform": "none"}, {"x": 48, "y": 812, "id": "overlay-93d77c98-7d11-4a82-9b58-13b2e72fe294", "type": "overlay", "width": 499, 